    {
      "name": "Null Collapse (1/day): The first time the nullifier is reduced to 72 HP or fewer, it can immediately release a wave of collapsing null energy",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Until the end of its next turn, its Nullifying Field radius increases to 20 feet. Creatures of the nullifier's choice in that area must succeed on a DC 15 Intelligence saving throw or take 22 (4d10) psychic damage and can't take reactions until the end of their next turn, and if they're concentrating, their concentration immediately ends. The creature must also make a Ruidium Corruption save. On a successful save, it takes half damage with no other effects.</p>",
